			"notes": "* Fixed relay nodes breaking when putting something besides them\n* Fixed blocks that break when something below them breaks duplicating when constructing a ship\n* Updated entity collisions + displacement + momentum transfer from ship to no longer use cache from static datasets\n* Fixed entities falling down when disassembling ship\n* All mentions of newtons in tooltips are now dynamically changed to bigger units (kilonewtons, meganewtons, etc), this is mostly due to how stupidly big the forces in this mod are\n* Added atmospheric pressure. This is to ensure that ships that use compressed valkyrium, engines, or propellers to go up will eventually slow down and reach a limit depending on how strong the upward force is. By default, y=256 is the point where atmospheric pressure is the limit, can be changed in config\n* Fixed crash with fairy lights\n* Made it so that hanging lights from fairy lights stay and don't disappear when assembling and disassembling the ship they're on\n* Added ship oaring. Using shovels (can be changed in config), you can row ships in water by hitting the water! Sneaking inverts oaring direction. Impulse from oaring can be changed in config.\n* Fixed bouncy blocks not being bouncy when on an assembled ship\n* Effortless Building can now be used to build shapes on assembled ships\n* Fixed ships being invisible when Nothirium/RenderLib is installed\n* Fixed log spam when StellarCore is installed\n* Fixed OBJ models not loading with StellarCore installed\n* Removed Picocli. `/vs` now uses vanilla command system and is now affected by Cleanroom's command autocomplete"
		},
