			"notes": "Please note that this mod requires [Forgelin Continuous](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgelin-continuous) and the [Cleanroom Modloader](https://cleanroommc.com/) to work!\n\n* Now bundled with [VS Control](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies-control) and [VS World](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies-world)\n* FIXED RUDDERS AT LAST\n* Right clicking on the captain's chair or the boat chair regardless of whether or not you were on the ship or not now makes you automatically mount them\n* Using wires on controllable ship components now prioritizes connecting the wire over controlling that ship component\n* Relay wires and vanishing wires when connected via nodes are now distinguished properly\n* Using control components not attached to ships no longer prints errors in the log\n* Segregated and modernized and cleaned up some of the code\n* Fixed gearboxes not permitting axle rotation when world is reloaded and are reoriented\n* Dismounting captain's chair maintains ship y position (can be undone by destroying the captain's chair)"
		}
